 \\\\ -2 & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338995 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "63c25817-90d5-5739-bde8-c7bb037f4127" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451537} {:answer/id #uuid "ce945b72-5264-5a5b-8a2f-5f3cc5335b1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451538}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186451537} :answer-field/id #uuid "75de82e6-fb57-5a51-a8f9-1335844b81db" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452616} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2aeacf71-84c6-5a17-9d5e-1859dec82bf3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451539} {:answer/id #uuid "1fb17603-bcaf-5635-9adf-ab7d73d0ab98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451540}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186451540} :answer-field/id #uuid "652e549d-bd49-5b19-8c97-310687a0bbc7" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452617} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fa6bd75a-5100-5a01-b2f9-62605056b7ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451541} {:answer/id #uuid "e078b049-aafa-54c7-bccb-956724005e82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451542}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186451542} :answer-field/id #uuid "9b789eb6-286f-59e6-b5ed-05232be7d77e" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452618}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "4139737b-7211-574f-84a7-c3e2691e81