 ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557767 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "696039bf-4b19-5cb1-b178-6b29548d1105" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557730} {:answer/id #uuid "eabda44b-f9a8-5f27-b2fa-00740c2ab541" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557793}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557730} :answer-field/id #uuid "00fcb256-4dfb-5083-89d1-c76082b6d89b" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557700} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5336188a-41c0-5ee3-b5ff-b215f42ed5a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557721} {:answer/id #uuid "99f095f1-43c3-57d7-b82b-34e083cf0de1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557748}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557748} :answer-field/id #uuid "99d4eefb-99fe-57f0-b1dd-b1f21dc966d7" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557747} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1fac1f39-7be8-5bdd-8437-10ddf03fd830" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557711} {:answer/id #uuid "cadbd61f-38c2-5075-adb8-c50598a25814" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557775}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557711} :answer-field/id #uuid "c6950a7a-77e0-5196-930a-37b6e5fb6219" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557773}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :questi