 ={I}_{3}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $DB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{3}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true. As a result, $D={B}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348162 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "df2e0d17-fa3f-5143-a321-2a068c4e955c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451711} {:answer/id #uuid "f34b5bc1-f3f2-51e7-9aea-110521bf1ca7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451712}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186451711} :answer-field/id #uuid "ff75d4bf-5306-5a64-b21f-bcf8026e0f99" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452703} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "99337b17-8708-5107-bfbe-9e15d078c7b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451713} {:answer/id #uuid "0a3e55a7-7e53-5335-93d5-f72501ec6ca3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451714}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186451713} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e5a87b9-5dfd-576e-8339-04eefdbcbdc7" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452704} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1acc48f8-6da1-5fa5-97b8-df620841b6d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451715} {:answer/id #uuid "b718884c-7aa3-5dd3-b317-af27816bbca6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451716}