\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{3}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557710 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e1f18c79-3b49-530d-8454-86379c0b9403" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557785} {:answer/id #uuid "e9d8a19d-14c7-57f9-99cc-9cac0d153cd9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557790}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557785} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ee91bd2-1a95-558f-be1a-abb6d916f84b" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557733} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9e9106c5-004e-5923-a1ee-f8a8ed480e8a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557750} {:answer/id #uuid "c2c423f1-fa46-5046-b322-201462bc9092" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #e