tatement I is true. As a result, $D={C}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $DE=ED={I}_{2}.$ Computing $DE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DE & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557719 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c064270a-45b0-5d37-a64c-f9bd3cd9b591" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557769} {:answer/id #uuid "fc515591-2d15-5fb3-814a-53134068b49e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557798}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557798} :answer-field/id #uuid "30ed5c96-6ee0-5f39-93b3-2c433c407047" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557712} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "af7d221a-e506-58c2-b708-2dc6e0aecacc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557760} {:answer/id #uuid "e4092b17-5e2b-5dae-8d40-155034ad4c5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557786}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557760} :answer-field/id #uuid "3583ba2a-bb42-5b1a-b10d-98b42a330396" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557714} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56893b98-2738-501f-917d-58a00ce969f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557723} {:answer/id #uuid "c58b7fa5-e8fb-56df-8329-c2b7be0a6bab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/